        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "2d738a3f-78ec-5fc6-aa89-00308cfbc0e2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Burt Kwouk, Herbert Lom, Graham Stark, Claudia Cardinale, Roberto Benigni, Jim Jarmusch, Federico Fellini, Paolo Villaggio, Nadia Ottaviani\n- Films: Son of the Pink Panther, The Pink Panther, The Voice of the Moon, Down by Law, Night on Earth, Coffee and Cigarettes\n- Film series: The Pink Panther film series\n- Roles: Cato, Inspector Clouseau's son\n\nFacts:\n- In 1986, Roberto Benigni collaborated with filmmaker Jim Jarmusch in the film Down by Law.\n- In 1990, Federico Fellini directed the Italian dramatic comedy film The Voice of the Moon, which starred Roberto Benigni, Paolo Villaggio, and Nadia Ottaviani.\n- In 1991, Roberto Benigni collaborated with Jim Jarmusch in the film Night on Earth.\n- In 1993, Son of the Pink Panther was released as a continuation of The Pink Panther film series.\n- In 1993, Roberto Benigni portrayed Inspector Clouseau's son in Son of the Pink Panther.\n- In 1993, Son of the Pink Panther also featured Panther regulars Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk, and Graham Stark, along with Claudia Cardinale, a star of the original 1963 film The Pink Panther.\n- Burt Kwouk was a British actor born on 18 July 1930 and died on 24 May 2016.\n- Burt Kwouk was known for playing Cato in the Pink Panther films.\n- In 2003, Roberto Benigni collaborated with Jim Jarmusch in the film Coffee and Cigarettes.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "773f48a0-9dea-58fc-92c8-bc00a7506cf2",
        "text": "Page: Son of the Pink Panther. Sentence: Son of the Pink Panther (1993) is a continuation of \"The Pink Panther\" film series.\nPage: Son of the Pink Panther. Sentence: Also in this film are \"Panther\" regulars Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk and Graham Stark and a star of the original 1963 film, Claudia Cardinale.\nPage: Burt Kwouk. Sentence: Herbert Tsangtse \"Burt\" Kwouk, OBE ( ; ; 18 July 1930 – 24 May 2016) was a British actor, known for his role as Cato in the \"Pink Panther\" films.\nPage: Roberto Benigni. Sentence: He also portrayed Inspector Clouseau's son in \"Son of the Pink Panther\" (1993) and has collaborated with filmmaker Jim Jarmusch in three of his films: \"Down by Law\" (1986), \"Night on Earth\" (1991) and \"Coffee and Cigarettes\" (2003).\nPage: The Voice of the Moon. Sentence: The Voice of the Moon (Italian: La voce della luna ) is a 1990 Italian dramatic comedy film directed by Federico Fellini and starring Roberto Benigni, Paolo Villaggio, and Nadia Ottaviani.",
